        "section_id": "nav:jamieson-fausset-brown:PSA.80:P:psa-80-1-19-shoshannim-lilies-see-on-psa-45-1-title-eduth-testimony-referring-",
        "navigation_id": "PSA.80:P:psa-80-1-19-shoshannim-lilies-see-on-psa-45-1-title-eduth-testimony-referring-",
        "scope": "passage",
        "role": "passage_overview",
        "title": "Psa 80:1-19 . Shoshannim--\"Lilies\" (see on Psa 45:1 , title). Eduth--Testimony, referring to the topic as a testimony of God to His people (compare Psa 19:7 ). This Psalm probably relates to the captivity of the ten tribes, as the former to that of Judah. Its complaint is aggravated by the contrast of former prosperity, and the prayer for relief occurs as a refrain through the Psalm."
      }
    ],
